This repository contains material derived from Terminal-Bench 2.1 (Merrill et al., 2026),
as distributed on Harbor Hub as the dataset terminal-bench/terminal-bench-2-1, which is
released under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The 89 tasks under tasks/long-easy/, tasks/long-medium/ and tasks/long-hard/ are modified
versions of Terminal-Bench 2.1 tasks. Each of them keeps its original authors (task.toml),
its original README.md and the Terminal-Bench canary string, and lists the files that were
modified or added in its MODIFICATIONS.md. Their environments are built on the original
tasks' published container images. The content hash of every original task is recorded in
metadata/source_task_hashes.csv.

The tasks under tasks/short-*/ and the grader files (tests/security_check.py,
tests/footprints.py, tests/attack.json) were written for TerminalSecurityBench.
